\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\b0\f0\fs21 Based on your exploration, answer:\par
Which AI-related role interests you most right now?\par
A.I am most interested in becoming an AI Application Developer\par
Why does it interest you?\par
A.  I love the idea of building complete end-to-end web applications that people will actually use. This role allows me to combine traditional software engineering with cutting-edge AI capabilities (like chatbots or data readers) without having to do heavy mathematical modeling.\par
What skills do you already have that may help?\par
