 3. Cloud deployment: I should also learn the fundamentals of cloud infrastructure and how my application can be hosted there using Docker and AWS (in the context of my DevOps Decode)\par
What would your 2-month learning roadmap look like?\par
A.In the first month, I would focus on learning web development fundamentals. This would entail doing a short course on FastAPI (to develop the back end of my apps) and studying JavaScript (to build better interfaces). In the second month, I would spend more time learning how my web apps can be deployed using cloud infrastructures. To practice, I could take my Smart Data Analytics Dashboard, containerize it with Docker, and then deploy it on a cloud platform so that it becomes accessible to anyone with an Internet connection\par
